<h1>Sharing knowledge & tested truths</h1>
<p>Welcome! This blog is a space where I share insights gained from personal experience and reflections on timeless principles, often inspired by biblical wisdom tested in daily life.</p>

<h2>Recent posts</h2>
<ul class="post-list">
    {# Loop through the 'posts_en' collection created in .eleventy.js #}
    {% set postsToList = collections.posts_en %}
    {% if postsToList.length == 0 %}
      <p>No posts yet in English.</p>
    {% else %}
      {% for post in postsToList %}
        <li class="post-list-item">
            {# Link to the post's generated URL #}
            <h3><a href="{{ site.baseURL }}{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h3>
            {# Use Eleventy's date filter #}
            <p class="post-list-meta">{{ post.date | date('LLL dd, yyyy') }}</p>
            {# Display description from post's front matter #}
            {% if post.data.description %}
              <p class="post-list-description">{{ post.data.description }}</p>
            {% endif %}
        </li>
      {% endfor %}
    {% endif %}
</ul>
